The Entralink is a mysterious place to
connect with someone's world.{VAR BE01}
If you cross a bridge in the Entralink,
you will be able to go to someone's world.{VAR BE01}
There, you should be able to help the
adventurer in that world.{VAR BE01}

The power stored in this tree is called
Pass Power.{VAR BE01}
You can register only one Pass Power in
your C-Gear. You use it by aiming at{VAR BE00}
people you pass by with the{VAR BE00}
Tag Log.{VAR BE01}
But you need a Pass Orb to use
Pass Power.{VAR BE01}
Carry out a mission in someone else's
world and collect Pass Orbs.{VAR BE01}

Oh, someone showed up...
Welcome to the Entralink.{VAR BE01}
Hm?{VAR BE01}
Judging by the look of you, you don't
seem to know where you are.{VAR BE01}

This is an island called the Entralink.
It's located in the center of the{VAR BE00}
Unova region.{VAR BE01}
The Entralink is a mysterious place where
you can connect with someone's world.{VAR BE01}
If you go to someone's world by passing
through this island, you will be able to{VAR BE00}
meet an adventurer in the world.{VAR BE01}

And you can help that adventurer.{VAR BE01}
Yes! If you want to help, cross a bridge
in this island and go to someone's world.{VAR BE01}
There must be someone who is waiting
for you there!

When you are on a bridge, a search will
start to find a person to connect with.{VAR BE01}
If the bridge connects, you will be able
to cross into that person's world.{VAR BE01}

This bridge will connect to the world of a
person who is having an adventurous{VAR BE00}
journey in a town or on a road{VAR BE00}
around the Entralink.{VAR BE01}
If you cross the bridge, you will be able
to help with that person's adventure.{VAR BE01}

Now, please go to the bridge.{VAR BE01}
If it connects to someone else's world,
you'll be able to cross.

