The Entree Forest connects dreams
and reality.{VAR BE01}
People say dreams come true here.{VAR BE01}

The Entree Forest is a place where
dreams come true.{VAR BE01}
When a dreaming Pokémon wakes up in
Game Sync, its dream will come true in{VAR BE00}
this forest.{VAR BE01}

Pokémon that your Pokémon met in its
dream will show up in the Entralink{VAR BE00}
in a Forest Clearing.{VAR BE01}
Pokémon in a Forest Clearing will be
your friends for sure!{VAR BE01}
If you move the Pokémon to the Deepest
Clearing, they will wait for you there.{VAR BE01}

Welcome to someone else's world.{VAR BE01}
Here, you can help the adventurer in
this world.{VAR BE01}
Now, touch this tree to receive
a mission.{VAR BE01}

To help the adventurer traveling in this
world, touch this tree and receive{VAR BE00}
a mission.{VAR BE01}

A mission is a means to help the
adventurer in this world.{VAR BE01}
If you check this tree, you can receive
a mission.{VAR BE01}
Now, receive a mission and go find
the adventurer.{VAR BE01}

In this world, you can travel by warping
around, because this world is made of{VAR BE00}
your dream.{VAR BE01}
If you imagine a place, you can
warp there.{VAR BE01}
Now, receive a mission and go find
the adventurer.{VAR BE01}

You've chosen a mission!
In order to accomplish the mission,{VAR BE00}
go find the adventurer!{VAR BE01}
The adventurer's location is shown on
the map below.{VAR BE01}
Touch the place on the map and you can
warp there.{VAR BE01}
Rely on the map, meet the adventurer,
and accomplish the mission!

Wonderful! You accomplished the mission!
I didn't expect you to make it this far...{VAR BE01}
Your success brought happiness to the
Entralink, and the tree grew a little bit.{VAR BE01}
Mysterious power will gather here as this
tree grows bigger.{VAR BE01}
You may be able to receive this power!{VAR BE01}
Touch this tree and try to receive the
mysterious power...{VAR BE00}
Pass Power.

Oh, it seems you've failed in the mission.
Well, nobody's perfect.{VAR BE01}
Please cross the bridge and try it again!{VAR BE01}
The tip is to look at the map closely and
find the adventurer.

Oooooh! You've received a Pass Power!
It's wonderful! Really wonderful!{VAR BE01}
Pass Power can help people who
passed by.{VAR BE01}
Check the Tag Log in your
C-Gear later.{VAR BE01}
...Well, that's really all I can
teach you.{VAR BE01}
The power of this Entralink is all yours.{VAR BE01}
Help a lot of adventurers via the
Entralink, and collect a lot of happiness.{VAR BE01}
Collect a lot of happiness, and get
all the powers!
